            "review_title": "Review at Boo Coffee",
            "review_text": "Ella Dougherty\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam9 contributions\n0\nA wonderfull view with delicious drinks\nJan 2019 • Family\nAs a group we had 2 families both with teenagers. As parents will well know it is sometimes difficult to please them. However, this coffee place being on the 9th floor had a gorgeous view with lovely drinks to top it off. Although the elevator is not free so we decided to walk up. In the hot Vietnam weather it wasn’t too bad with a slow pace but was refreshing to step into a fully air conditioned room at Boo. Overall if you want to go to this coffee shop and the apartment building now used for shops you will need to move quickly as it is soon to be knocked down but I fully recommend it.\nRead more\nWritten January 16, 2019",
