            "review_text": "Steven S\nMedan, Indonesia862 contributions\n0\nThe Cafe Apartment on Saigon Walking Street\nMar 2017 • Couples\nTake a pick at the many cafes you are interested from the walking street. Then climb up the stairs of pay money to ride the lift. We picked the prior just for the fun of it. Plus this way we get to slowly appreciate the old apartment building plus sneak peak at other cafes along the different floor levels. Ended up at Boo Coffee as this cafe has two apartments making it a bigger of any other cafes. And plus we get the seating just in front of the balcony viewing the walking street. Very windy and cool enough to survive without aircon. Coffee is typical Vietnamese coffee, strong and bold. Recommended!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 12, 2017",
