            "review_text": "Diana N\n101 contributions\n0\nTrendy Drinks!\nMay 2016 • Couples\nThis place is a complete copy of the \"Snow Monster\" cafes from California.\n\nThe lavish drinks and even the logo are exactly the same, but I guess there's no harm done when they're on the other side of the planet! They offer popular milk tea flavors and you even have the option to top it with cotton candy (looks like a giant afro). Not only are they visually appealing for your Instagram or facebook, they do a good job in making them taste good too. Sidenote: There is someone on the elevator that tries to charge you for using the elevator. I felt it was ridiculous so my boyfriend and I suffered the long walk up the stairs; quite the funny memory!\n\nYou can tell the girls running Boo coffee try real hard to make their drinks taste and look perfect so it's definitely worth a visit.\nRead more\nWritten February 19, 2017",
